            "review_title": "Review at La Plume Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "SCopra\nGurgaon District, India26 contributions\n0\nVegetarian food at reasonable prices\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nThe restaurant has a Vietnamese and a french side. I had gone for dinner and chose the french side. They had a set menu for vegetarians but I chose only a Mushroom soup ,which came with a bread basket. The soup was delicious, service pleasant & available while the ambiance was elegant but relaxed. \nNot noisy with nice soft music. The staff was very attentive, since I was dining alone, I had carried a book and was reading while waiting for my soup, one of them immediately increased the lighting in the room and checked if it was fine with me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 28, 2017\nPressClub H\nDear SCopra, \n\nA warm thank you for your comment and feedback on La Plume Bar & Lounge. It was a pleasure to receive you in our establishment. \n\nThe comment was transmitted to the whole team and it is always the best recipe to motivate the staff and to keep up the good work ! \n\nThank you again and we hope to receive you again soon, \n\nThe Press Club Team\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
