            "review_text": "GGGClub\nSorrento, Australia1354 contributions\n0\nCosy and elegant\nNov 2016 • Business\nNice place located on the 3rd floor of the famous Press Club, it offers a warm atmosphere, ideal for a meeting, a drink, food and a cigar too!\nGood service from a well trained staff, professional advice from a charming lady sommelier and some finger food to go along your aperitive.\nDefinitely a pleasant place.\nWell done guys!\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2016\nPressClub H\nThank you so much for your kind comments. We are trying to give our valued guests the best services. Hope to welcome you in the near future.\n\nAll the best,\nMarketing Team.\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
