            "review_title": "Review at La Plume Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Linh T\n8 contributions\n0\nAmazing Bartender\nFeb 2016 • Family\nWith my family we came to the place for a dinner but discover this La Plume Bar by surprise, next door to La table du chef restaurant. My family and I we all have a very good moment with mr. Tiep Bartender, used to be Champion Vietnam 2012 and each of his creation always wearing a different story, funny, honest and very touching. My mom is almost crying when he talked about his fullmoon cocktail story. Decoration style inspired by the legend Long Bien bridge, a lot of painting arts related, nice music and very friendly staffs. Will come back for sure with my ladies group ;)\nRead more\nWritten June 3, 2016",
